00:07:53.887 --> 00:07:55.720
It really doesn't get
any simpler than this.

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:57.636
If you can come up with
a simpler Hello World,

00:07:57.636 --> 00:07:59.170
let me know.

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:03.270
And then I heard a dockerfile,
