00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:22.860
It's idiomatic.

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:25.020
I should be able to test
it and run it here, right?

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.910
So if you're
familiar with Docker,

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:29.670
