00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:36.150
So it's going to go
do a little build.

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:39.280
It's going to produce
a container for me.

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:42.120
This went a lot
faster in rehearsal.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:43.842
There we go.

00:08:43.842 --> 00:08:46.300
And I'll just run that container
